---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Healthcare — Fusionedge">
<div class="cs">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Public+Sans:ital,wght@0,400..700;1,400..700&display=swap">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="hc-hero">
      <div>
        <span class="cs-tag">Healthcare</span>
        <h1><span class="it-l">Patient care depends on a</span> <span class="it-l">hospital <span class="cs-ul">that never stops.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="cs-lead">Oxygen plants, OT air handling, DG sets, lifts and hundreds of biomedical devices have to work every hour of every day. FusionEdge keeps every asset maintained, every area cleaned on time, and every audit backed by proof.</p>
        <div class="cs-btns">
          <a class="cs-btn cs-p" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
          <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Talk to Sales</a>
        </div>
        <div class="it-trust"><span>All 26 apps in one plan</span><span>ISO 27001:2022 certified</span><span>Photo and time-stamp proof</span></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hc-vis" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the FusionEdge mobile app with a cleaning checklist, and status cards">
        <div class="hc-phone">
          <div class="hc-notch"></div>
          <div class="hc-scr">
            <div class="hc-app-h"><small>Housekeeping</small><b>ICU-3 · Cleaning round</b><span>Due 10:30 · Assigned to you</span></div>
            <div class="hc-prog"><em><i style="width:75%"></i></em><span>6 of 8</span></div>
            <ul class="hc-cl">
              <li class="d">Bed rails and side tables</li>
              <li class="d">Monitors and IV stands</li>
              <li class="d">Floor, wet mop</li>
              <li class="d">Hand-rub dispensers refilled</li>
              <li class="d">Biomedical waste cleared</li>
              <li class="d">Washroom</li>
              <li>Door handles and switches</li>
              <li>Upload photo</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hc-photo"><span>Add photo</span></div>
            <span class="hc-btn">Submit round</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hc-float hc-f1"><i class="dot g"></i><div><b>Oxygen plant</b><span>Pressure normal</span></div></div>
        <div class="hc-float hc-f2"><i class="dot a"></i><div><b>Calibration due</b><span>Infusion pump · 7 days</span></div></div>
        <div class="hc-float hc-f3"><span class="hc-fi">✓</span><div><b>Audit report ready</b><span>ICU · last 90 days</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Stakes -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">What’s at stake</span><h2>In a hospital, a missed task is never small</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">A late repair or a skipped cleaning round can reach a patient. Paper logs and phone calls make it hard to know what was done, by whom and when.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-stakes">
        <article class="hc-stake"><span class="hc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2"/></svg></span><div><h3>Critical equipment cannot fail</h3><p>Oxygen supply, OT air handling, DG sets and imaging chillers need planned maintenance that actually happens, with alerts the moment something drifts.</p></div></article>
        <article class="hc-stake"><span class="hc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l8 4v5c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V7z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><div><h3>Infection control needs proof</h3><p>Wards, ICUs and OTs follow strict cleaning schedules. Every round should be logged with a photo and time stamp, not ticked on paper.</p></div></article>
        <article class="hc-stake"><span class="hc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M8 7h8M8 11h8M8 15h5"/></svg></span><div><h3>Audits arrive with little notice</h3><p>Accreditation and statutory audits ask for asset history, calibration records and checklists. Pulling them from files takes days.</p></div></article>
        <article class="hc-stake"><span class="hc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="8" r="4"/><path d="M4 21a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/></svg></span><div><h3>Thousands of people every day</h3><p>Patients, attendants, visitors and vendors move through the building. Security needs to know who is where, and complaints need a fast owner.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- Zones -->
  <div class="cs-tint">
    <div class="cs-w">
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">Across the hospital</span><h2>Built for every corner of the hospital</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Each team works in its own area, on the same platform, with the same asset records and the same rules.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hc-zones">
        <article class="hc-zone"><em>01</em><h3>Operation theatres</h3><p>Air handling, medical gases and equipment checked before every list, with faults escalated at once.</p><div class="hc-mods"><span>PPM</span><span>Readings &amp; Logs</span><span>Smart Ticketing</span></div></article>
        <article class="hc-zone"><em>02</em><h3>ICUs and wards</h3><p>Cleaning rounds, bed-side equipment and nurse requests tracked live, ward by ward.</p><div class="hc-mods"><span>Digital Checklists</span><span>Smart Ticketing</span></div></article>
        <article class="hc-zone"><em>03</em><h3>Biomedical</h3><p>Every device with its service history, warranty, AMC and calibration due dates in one register.</p><div class="hc-mods"><span>Asset Management</span><span>AMC Tracker</span></div></article>
        <article class="hc-zone"><em>04</em><h3>Utilities and plant rooms</h3><p>Oxygen plant, DG sets, chillers and STPs read at set times, with spikes and drops flagged early.</p><div class="hc-mods"><span>Readings &amp; Logs</span><span>Asset Health</span></div></article>
        <article class="hc-zone"><em>05</em><h3>Housekeeping</h3><p>The same schedules and checklists in every block, closed with a photo as proof.</p><div class="hc-mods"><span>Digital Checklists</span><span>Inspect</span></div></article>
        <article class="hc-zone"><em>06</em><h3>Front desk and security</h3><p>Visitor passes for attendants and vendors, and feedback captured by QR code.</p><div class="hc-mods"><span>Visitor Management</span><span>Feedback &amp; Survey</span></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Audit band -->
  <div class="hc-audit">
    <div class="cs-w hc-audit-in">
      <div>
        <span class="cs-tag">Compliance</span>
        <h2>Audit-ready on any day, not just audit day</h2>
        <p class="cs-lead">Every task in FusionEdge leaves a trail. When the auditor asks, the answer is a few clicks away.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="hc-checks">
        <li><div><b>Photo and time-stamp proof</b><span>Every checklist and work order closed with evidence.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b>Full asset history</b><span>Service, breakdowns, AMC and calibration for every device.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b>SLA and escalation logs</b><span>Who was alerted, when, and how fast the issue was closed.</span></div></li>
        <li><div><b>One-click audit reports</b><span>Export records by area, asset or date range.</span></div></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Security -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <section>
      <div class="cs-head">
        <div><span class="cs-tag">Security</span><h2>Built to protect sensitive data</h2></div>
        <p class="cs-lead">Hospitals hold some of the most sensitive data there is. FusionEdge is built with that in mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="it-sec">
        <div><b>ISO 27001:2022</b><span>Certified information security</span></div>
        <div><b>AES-256</b><span>Encryption for your data</span></div>
        <div><b>Two-factor auth</b><span>And role-based access control</span></div>
        <div><b>WAF &amp; DDoS</b><span>Protection, logging and monitoring</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <div class="cs-w">
    <div class="cs-cta">
      <span class="cs-tag" style="color:#e6d6ee">Get Started</span>
      <h2 style="margin-top:14px;max-width:24ch">See FusionEdge running in a hospital like yours</h2>
      <p>Book a demo and we will walk you through the modules for your theatres, wards, plant rooms and front desk. No card and no setup fee.</p>
      <div class="cs-btns">
        <a class="cs-btn cs-g" href="https://fusionedge.io/request-demo/">Book a Demo <span class="cs-ar">→</span></a>
        <a class="cs-btn" href="https://fusionedge.io/contact/">Contact Sales</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</Layout>

<style>
.cs{
  --bg:#fff;--soft:#f4eff7;--ink:#1b1530;--mut:#6c6780;--line:#ebe6f0;--card:#fff;
  --brand:#5D1F72;--green:#00BF88;--green-ink:#00a576;--ph:#ece7f0;--phx:#9a91a6;
  --r:16px;--sec:clamp(72px,10vw,120px);color-scheme:light
}
.cs,.cs *{box-sizing:border-box}
.cs{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif;line-height:1.6;width:100%}
.cs,.cs *,.cs *::before,.cs *::after{font-family:"Public Sans",sans-serif!important}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3,.cs p{margin:0}
.cs h1,.cs h2,.cs h3{color:var(--ink)}
.cs-w{max-width:1160px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,4vw,40px)}

/* Type — italic display headings like the main site */
.cs h1{font-size:clamp(28px,5.2vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic}
.cs h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,38px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-.025em;font-weight:600;font-style:italic;text-wrap:balance}
.cs h3{font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:600;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-lead{font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,17px);color:var(--mut);line-height:1.7}
.cs-ul{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-color:var(--green);text-decoration-thickness:3px;text-underline-offset:8px}

/* Bits */
.cs-tag{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--brand)}
.cs-tag::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor}
.cs-pill{font-size:12.5px;padding:5px 12px;border-radius:99px;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border:1px solid #dccde6}
.cs-btns{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cs-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:99px;font:600 14px/1 "Public Sans",sans-serif;
  border:1px solid #d9cfe2;background:#fff;color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none;transition:transform .15s,background .15s,border-color .15s,box-shadow .15s}
.cs-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs-btn.cs-g{background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-color:var(--brand)}
.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(93,31,114,.25)}
.cs-btn .cs-ar{transition:transform .15s}.cs-btn:hover .cs-ar{transform:translateX(3px)}

.cs-ph{background:var(--ph);color:var(--phx);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:12px;border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden}
.cs-ph::before{content:"Image"}

/* Hero */
.cs-hero{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,104px) 0 0;text-align:center}
.cs-hero h1{margin:0 auto;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-sub{font-size:clamp(15px,2.2vw,21px);font-weight:600;font-style:italic;margin:18px auto 0;white-space:nowrap}
.cs-hero .cs-lead{max-width:780px;margin:16px auto 32px;text-wrap:balance}
.cs-hero .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-checks{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:40px auto 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;max-width:1040px;text-align:left}
.cs-checks li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.45;color:var(--ink);padding:16px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-checks li::before{content:"✓";flex:none;width:20px;height:20px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}
.cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:16/7;margin-top:clamp(40px,6vw,64px);border-radius:24px}
@media (max-width:640px){.cs-hero .cs-sub{white-space:normal;max-width:30ch}}
@media (max-width:480px){.cs-hero h1{white-space:normal;max-width:12ch}}

/* Stats */
.cs-stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));margin:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats div{padding:28px clamp(16px,2.5vw,32px)}
.cs-stats div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--line)}
.cs-stats b{display:block;font-size:clamp(32px,4vw,48px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1;color:var(--green-ink)}
.cs-stats span{display:block;font-size:14px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px}

/* Sections */
.cs section{margin-top:var(--sec)}
.cs-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(20px,5vw,80px);align-items:end;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-head h2{margin-top:14px}

.cs-grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:clamp(16px,2vw,24px)}
.cs-card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);overflow:hidden;background:var(--card);display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(93,31,114,.06);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.cs-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 16px 36px rgba(93,31,114,.12)}
.cs-card .cs-ph{border-radius:0;aspect-ratio:16/10}
.cs-grid2 .cs-card .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:16/8}
.cs-card .cs-b{padding:22px 22px 24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.cs-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.65}
.cs-card .cs-n{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:var(--green-ink);letter-spacing:.04em}

/* Purple band */
.cs-band{margin-top:var(--sec);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;padding:clamp(56px,8vw,96px) 0;text-align:center}
.cs-band h2{color:#fff}
.cs-band p{margin:14px auto 0;max-width:640px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}

/* Feature rows */
.cs-feat{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.05fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(32px,6vw,88px);align-items:center}
.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1.05fr)}
.cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:2}
.cs-feat .cs-ph{aspect-ratio:5/4;border-radius:24px}
.cs-feat .cs-t{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
.cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--mut);line-height:1.75}
.cs-tags{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chips{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;width:100%;max-width:420px;margin-top:6px}
.cs-chip{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(93,31,114,.05)}
.cs-chip b{display:block;font-size:20px;color:var(--green-ink);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:2px}

/* Lavender section */
.cs-tint{background:var(--soft);margin-top:var(--sec);padding:var(--sec) 0}
.cs-tint section{margin-top:0}

/* CTA */
.cs-cta{margin:var(--sec) 0 clamp(56px,8vw,96px);background:var(--brand);color:#fff;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;
  padding:clamp(56px,8vw,88px) clamp(20px,4vw,48px)}
.cs-cta h2{max-width:20ch;margin:0 auto;color:#fff}
.cs-cta p{max-width:560px;margin:16px auto 32px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.5vw,17px);color:#e6d6ee}
.cs-cta .cs-btns{justify-content:center}
.cs-cta .cs-btn.cs-g{background:#fff;color:var(--brand);border-color:#fff}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g){background:transparent;color:#fff;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.4)}
.cs-cta .cs-btn:not(.cs-g):hover{border-color:#fff}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width:960px){.cs-checks{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.cs-grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(3){border-left:0}
  .cs-stats div:nth-child(n+3){border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-head{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:14px}
  .cs-feat,.cs-feat.cs-rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:28px}
  .cs-feat.cs-rev .cs-ph{order:0}
  .cs-hero-img{aspect-ratio:4/3}
}
@media (max-width:560px){.cs-checks,.cs-grid3,.cs-grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cs-btns .cs-btn{flex:1 1 auto}}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.cs *{transition:none!important}}

/* Button colours locked so global link styles can't override them */
.cs a.cs-btn,.cs a.cs-btn:visited{color:var(--brand)!important;text-decoration:none!important}
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-p:hover,
.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:#fff!important}
.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g,.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g:visited,.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn.cs-g:hover{color:var(--brand)!important}
.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn:not(.cs-g),.cs .cs-cta a.cs-btn:not(.cs-g):visited{color:#fff!important}

/* Extra responsive polish */
.cs img,.cs svg{max-width:100%}
.cs{overflow-x:clip}
@media (max-width:760px){
  .cs-hero{padding-top:48px}
  .cs-checks{margin-top:28px}
  .cs-card .cs-b{padding:18px}
  .cs-feat .cs-t p{font-size:15px}
  .cs-chips{max-width:none}
}
@media (max-width:560px){
  .cs-btns{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;width:100%;max-width:360px;margin:0 auto}
  .cs-feat .cs-t .cs-btns{margin:0}
  .cs-btn{width:100%}
  .cs-stats b{font-size:32px}
  .cs-stats div{padding:20px 14px}
  .cs-hero-img,.cs-feat .cs-ph{border-radius:16px}
  .cs-cta{border-radius:18px}
}
@media (max-width:360px){
  .cs-stats{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .cs-stats div{border-left:0!important}
  .cs-stats div+div{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
  .cs-chips{grid-template-columns:1fr}
}


/* ===== Healthcare additions ===== */
.hc-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(0,.85fr);gap:clamp(28px,4vw,56px);align-items:center;padding:clamp(48px,7vw,96px) 0 0}
.cs .hc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(26px,2.9vw,38px);line-height:1.15;margin:16px 0 0}
.it-l{display:block;white-space:nowrap}
.hc-hero .cs-lead{margin:20px 0 30px;max-width:560px}
.it-trust{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;margin-top:28px;font-size:13px;color:var(--mut)}
.it-trust span{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
.it-trust span::before{content:"✓";width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;display:grid;place-items:center}
/* Campus mock — product UI */
.it-campus{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e6e0ec;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(27,21,48,.04),0 24px 60px -12px rgba(93,31,114,.18);overflow:hidden;font-size:12px}
.it-cbar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid #efeaf3;background:#fbfafc}
.it-dots{display:flex;gap:5px}.it-dots i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#e2dce8}
.it-crumb{flex:1;font-size:12px;color:var(--mut)}.it-crumb i{font-style:normal;margin:0 4px;color:#c9c2d3}.it-crumb b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}
.it-site{font-size:11px;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid #e6e0ec;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;background:#fff}
.it-live{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;color:#00875f;background:#e8f8f1;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:99px}
.it-live::before{content:"";width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green)}
.it-cbody{padding:clamp(14px,1.8vw,18px);display:grid;gap:12px}
.it-kpis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));border:1px solid #efeaf3;border-radius:10px}
.it-kpis div{padding:10px 12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;grid-template-rows:auto auto auto;column-gap:6px}
.it-kpis div+div{border-left:1px solid #efeaf3}
.it-kpis small{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--mut);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em}
.it-kpis strong{font-size:clamp(16px,1.5vw,19px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--ink);margin-top:3px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
